# GitHub has no Heather grammar, so borrow Rust's for highlighting in file
# and diff views: `//` comments, strings and 'c' characters, `::` paths,
# `<...>` generics, braces and `fn`/`let`/`match`/`impl`/`self` all line up.
# Heather-only keywords (`theorem`, `inductive`, `record`, ...) stay plain.
# `linguist-detectable=false` keeps .hthr out of the repo's language stats,
# so the library isn't counted as Rust.
*.hthr linguist-language=Rust linguist-detectable=false
